        "text": "=📞 Follow-up Reminder\n\n**Contact:** {{ $('📝 Set Sample Data').item.json.contact_name }}\n**Context:** {{ $('📝 Set Sample Data').item.json.context }}\n\n**Suggested Message:**\n{{ $json.output }}",
